## Schema and storage choices

**Sketch:** `Restaurant`, `Dish`, `Order`, `OrderLine` — orders are **relational**; menu can be **JSON/doc** per restaurant for flexible modifiers.

| Store | Holds | Why |
|-------|--------|-----|
| OLTP SQL | Orders, money-adjacent state | ACID |
| Document / wide JSON | Menu display blobs | Flexible schema |
| Search index | Text + facets | Inverted index |
| Redis | Hot lists, per-cell caches, rate limits | Speed |
| OLAP / lake | Metrics, training data | Cheap scans |

---

## Ranking pipeline

**Signals:** distance/ETA, CTR/CVR history, rating, business rules, inventory hints, user affinity.  
**Offline + online:** batch aggregates to **feature store**; online **blend** + **re-rank**; reserve slots for **exploration**.  
**Optimization:** **retrieve wide, rank narrow**; **precompute** heavy aggregates.

---

## Caching strategy

| Layer | Content | Notes |
|-------|---------|--------|
| CDN | Images, static campaigns | Purge + TTL |
| Edge/API cache | Section fragments | Short TTL; **vary by location bucket** |
| Redis | Per-cell lists, featured sets | **Stampede:** single-flight / jitter |
| App | Config, flags | Minutes |

**Policy:** “Trending” can be **stale**; **open/closed** uses **short TTL** + version.

---

## Metrics

1. **Most ordered restaurant** — fact table on `orders.restaurant_id`.  
2. **Most ordered dish** — `order_lines.dish_id`.  
3. **Orders per restaurant** — same; expose in BI + optional **Redis** for ops dashboards.

**Strong hire:** “**Source of truth** is orders in OLTP → **stream** to warehouse; **cache** only for **read acceleration**, not definitions.”

---

## Tradeoffs

| Decision | Upside | Downside |
|----------|--------|----------|
| Push heavy rank **online** | Fresher personalization | Tail latency risk |
| More **Redis** on geo | Fast reads | Stale/incorrect if not invalidated |
| Strong **inventory** on list | Trust | Harder scale; more joins |
| Two-stage rank | Latency control | More moving parts |

---

## Bottlenecks, failures, mitigations

| Risk | Mitigation |
|------|------------|
| **Hot geocell** | Sub-partition; read replicas; cap + backoff |
| Ranker **timeout** | Fallback sort; circuit breaker |
| **Cache stampede** | Single-flight, TTL jitter, early refresh |
| **Stale menu** | Version keys; short TTL on price |
| Bad GPS | Explicit UX + saved addresses |

---

## Reliability and observability

- **SLOs:** homepage **p99**, ranker **p95**, spatial **error rate**.  
- **Tracing** span per stage (loc, geo, rank, assemble).  
- **Alerts:** rank fallback rate, empty-cell rate, cache **miss storm**.  
- **Load shed:** drop nonessential sections first.

